  ok   map gives zeroed pages that can be written
  ok   a map that fails part-way changes nothing
  ok   map and unmap accept only whole pages inside user space
  ok   unmap gives every page frame back
  ok   a task cannot take more memory than its quota
  ok   shared memory keeps the rights and the bounds of its capability
  ok   a copy of a memory capability covers the same pages or fewer
  ok   a program cannot run code from its stack
  ok   a program cannot run code from its data
